      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "Great phone @ price point. This Galaxy S10e will need a case. I got an otterbox defender for about 35$, mainly because the 1st day i got my S10e it slipped out of my hand because it is very small & the back left hand corner has been cracked because the backs of the s10e are also glass. (This S10e is alot smaller than my old StraightTalk Samsung Galaxy J3 @walmart). The S10e's performance is much...",
          "aspect": "build",
