          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2021-11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good alternative to new. Phone arrived quickly, and is what was described. Was worried it may have been a carrier phone, but nope, it was the unlocked Samsung version! I replaced a damaged s10e, so knew what to expect, Sim card changed and the item has been working perfectly! ONE item that's a bit annoying is the forward facing main camera has dust or some other obstruction. It is always slightly...",
          "aspect": "build",
          "sentiment": -0.9893524590879679,
          "stars": 4,
          "month": "2021-10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Looks like new. I can hardly tell this is a refurbished phone. If this would have been sold as new I wouldn't have complained. The screen is perfect. The battery life is just like new, so it must have just been lightly used and then returned by someone else. I'll probably never buy a new phone again. I inserted the SIM card and it got on Verizon's network right away.",
