      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "False adevertising. The product was supposed to be fully unlocked. I tried to activate it on my network. And come to find out after calling Samsung. The phone is tied up on the Verizon network. So now I have to call them and try to unlock it and then activate it. Just an inconvenience.",
