          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2020-07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Decent screen, nothing else worth buying. Beautiful screen, mediocre battery, poor integration with Google services, and constantly trying to sell me useless services instead. For example, it kept telling me that my home Wi-Fi is highly insecure and that I should be subscribing to there security solution at an outrageous cost. The prompts would not go away no matter how I configured it or told it...",
          "aspect": "connectivity",
