          "stars": 1,
          "month": "2020-05"
        },
        {
          "text": "Premium phone at budget price!. I love absolutely everything in this phone. It is light, compact, and fast. More importantly it is not crazy expensive like other premium phones. Would definitely recommend it!",
          "aspect": "build",
          "sentiment": 0.395358256297186,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2020-07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Very happy!. I use T-Mobile in the United States and this phone is working perfectly. I received what you would typically expect from a refurbished item, just the phone, a wall adapter, and usb cable in a nondescript box. I was a tiny bit worried from other reviews stating they were receiving phones that weren't unlocked but this unit is flawless. Mine was purchased from the seller Hybrid IT, so...",
          "aspect": "build",
          "sentiment": 0.9797414174827281,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2020-05"
        },
        {
          "text": "Great Phone For First Time Flagship Buyers.. Fantastic camera, great battery life despite its capacity, display is also great despite its size. Couldn't be happier. (Upgrading from a Galaxy A20.) The phone came as advertised. Arrived with a charger, and the device. (Empty battery for safety reasons) No imperfections despite it being renewed (Like New) Charged up and setup the device and its...",
          "aspect": "charging",
