      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "Just Fine. I wanted a relatively small phone after replacing a Galaxy J-7 (my 2nd J-7) with an A21. The A21 just seemed too big and awkward for me after being used to the smaller sized J-7 phones. I saw this s10e renewed - here on Amazon - and after thinking about it for a few days, decided to take a chance. I am very happy I did. The s10e is actually a little smaller than the J-7 and way smaller...",
          "aspect": "build",
