          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2021-07"
        },
        {
          "text": "A phone worth the price. Great phone, I am an iPhone owner for decades but I liked this one, the design is nice, I liked the package, the shipping was fast ! I would buy again and again",
          "aspect": "build",
