          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2021-06"
        },
        {
          "text": "Small. Small. Details say 5.8 or 5.9 inches, but it\u2019s barely 5.5 inches. We were trying to get something my mother in law could easily see. I don\u2019t know about this. Will update when she activates it.",
          "aspect": "software",
