          "stars": 3,
          "month": "2021-06"
        },
        {
          "text": "100% Recommend to Anyone Looking. At first I was scared but now that I have the phone, I realized it was by far the best purchase I've made on a phone ever. For the reviews saying it was locked to a carrier, make sure you're getting it FULLY unlocked or at least unlocked for your carrier. Bought mine Fully Unlocked and using it with Cricket Wireless without issues. Cameras are great it's fast and...",
          "aspect": "software",
          "sentiment": 0.9941833836201113,
          "stars": 5,
          "month": "2021-06"
        },
        {
